# Batteriq Kenya

> Batteriq (Batteriq Solutions Ltd) is the authorised EcoFlow dealer in Kenya and also sells BLUETTI. It sells portable power stations, solar panels, home battery backup systems and accessories online at batteriq.com, based in Nairobi with delivery to all 47 counties. Payment by M-Pesa (STK Push), Visa/Mastercard, or cash/M-Pesa on delivery. Every order includes an eTIMS (KRA) invoice.

Key facts:
- Business: Batteriq Solutions Ltd, Nairobi, Kenya
- Phone / WhatsApp: +254 716 822 014
- Email: info@batteriq.com
- Hours: Mon–Sat 08:00–18:00 (EAT); online orders any time
- Brands: EcoFlow (authorised dealer), BLUETTI
- Warranty: 24 months on EcoFlow power stations, handled locally in Kenya
- Delivery: Nairobi delivery and nationwide courier to all 47 counties
- Prices are in Kenya shillings (KES) and are kept current on each product page

## Main pages

- [EcoFlow Kenya](https://batteriq.com/ecoflow-kenya): authorised EcoFlow dealer hub
- [Power stations](https://batteriq.com/power-stations): all portable power stations
- [Solar panels](https://batteriq.com/solar): portable and rigid solar panels
- [BLUETTI Kenya](https://batteriq.com/bluetti): BLUETTI power stations
- [Accessories](https://batteriq.com/accessories): cables, extra batteries and accessories
- [Compare](https://batteriq.com/compare): side-by-side power station comparison
- [Answers](https://batteriq.com/answers): direct answers to common backup-power questions in Kenya
- [FAQ](https://batteriq.com/support/faq): payments, delivery, warranty and product FAQs
- [Warranty registration](https://batteriq.com/support/warranty)
- [Track order](https://batteriq.com/track-order)
- [Contact](https://batteriq.com/contact)
- [About](https://batteriq.com/about)

